<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Chandak Group is one of India&rsquo;s most well known developers and has carved a niche for itself in the Mumbai property market. It is known for possessing experience of more than two decades along with top notch implementation systems. Both residential and commercial properties are developed while the portfolio of Chandak projects encompasses more than 2 million sq. ft. Another 2 million sq. ft. is also being developed across diverse locations in Maximum City. Value driven, the Group has always synonymous for transparent business dealings in addition to customer commitment along with comprehensively researched, high quality housing units at well connected areas. The customer always comes first here while stringent quality standards are adhered to at all times. Futuristic vision is also regarded highly along with implementation of cutting edge technologies. Long lasting customer relationships along with utmost buyer satisfaction are major goals as well. Key offerings include Sparkling Wings, Paloma, etc.</p></div>
